{"schema_version":1,"key":"dish-35820a0555d3","reference_recipes":[{"id":"howtocook-35820a0555d3","name":"蒸花卷","category":"breakfast","url":"https://github.com/Anduin2017/HowToCook/blob/0e106eea348c734fe1586f781202994439cf98a5/dishes/breakfast/%E8%92%B8%E8%8A%B1%E5%8D%B7.md","blob_sha":"c5f3502ab8d5e76b5e2b43dd0628541ca544d2da","details":{"introduction":"这是一道北方传统面食，松软可口，带着淡淡麦香。使用冷冻花卷蒸制，能快速补充碳水化合物和膳食纤维。做法极其简单，烹饪新手也能轻松掌握，全程仅需半小时，是理想的快手早餐。","difficulty":"★★","sections":[{"heading":"必备原料和工具","markdown":"- 冷冻花卷\n- 圆碟子\n- 蒸架\n- 水 400ml"},{"heading":"计算","markdown":"- 冷冻花卷 5 个（女生分量 3 个即可）（可以在超市、各种买菜平台购买）\n- 圆碟子，直径 28cm\n- 蒸架，直径 20cm\n- 水 400ml"},{"heading":"操作","markdown":"1. 从花卷的包装袋中取出 5 个花卷\n2. 把花卷平铺在碟子上，尽量不用重叠\n3. 往锅里倒入 400ml 水，把蒸架放里面，把装花卷的碟子放在蒸架上，盖上锅盖。\n4. 开大火加热，直至水沸腾。\n5. 转中火加热 15 分钟\n6. 开盖用手感受花卷的表面温度，如果不够热，就继续盖上盖子加热，否则就可以关火出锅。\n7. 碟子取出放凉至 50 度即可食用"},{"heading":"附加内容","markdown":"- 操作时，需要注意观察锅里的水不能少于 50ml。"}]}}],"nutrition":{"status":"reference","basis":"per_100g","serving_g":null,"scope":"2–3人家庭标准配方估算：通用小麦面粉300g、饮用水180g、干酵母4g、大豆食用油15g、食盐3g、小葱15g；整份约550g。葱油花卷，发酵损失未校正；蒸锅水不作为食材。净量及成品重为明确标准假设，非实测；未做烹饪损失校正，所有列入的油糖酱均计入。","per_100g":{"energy_kcal":225.890909,"protein_g":5.961909,"carbohydrate_g":42.118,"fat_g":3.322345},"source":{"name":"USDA FoodData Central","url":"https://fdc.nal.usda.gov/food-details/169761/nutrients","version":"4c2e507cd20edaf8","fdc_ids":[169761,173647,175043,171411,173468,170005]},"profile_id":"family-35820a0555d3-v1","recipe_id":"howtocook-35820a0555d3","review_status":"approved","method":"usda_recipe_estimate","recipe_basis":"standardized_assumptions","is_estimate":true,"match":{"food_identity":"howtocook-35820a0555d3","state":"ready_to_eat","cooking_method":"covered_steaming","edible_part":"explicit_net_edible_ingredients_without_bones_shells_or_discarded_parts","oil_added":true,"sugar_added":false,"sauce_added":false,"brand":null,"variant":"family-35820a0555d3-v1","standard_ingredients":[{"key":"flour","grams":300},{"key":"water","grams":180},{"k